{#
  The first thing past the fold. The alt-games block at the bottom of the page
  does the same job, but it sits under the FAQ and almost nobody scrolls that
  far. A real <a> to the hub, so it is a crawlable internal link and
  middle-click works.

  The 56px top margin in base.css is load-bearing: .home-fold reserves 120px
  below itself as a scroll hint, and this has to clear whatever is left of that
  reserve. Dance is tightest at 38px because its topbar sits 12px higher.
  Byte-identical across all three games, which is why it is one file.
#}
{% macro moreGamesCta(label) %}
<div class="more-games-cta">
        <a class="pill-btn" href="/">{{ label | safe }}</a>
      </div>
{% endmacro %}
